# Functions currently over the complexity limits, frozen at their present
# numbers. Frozen 2026-09-15, the first run with --ratchets on.
#
# Format: <path> | <function> | <metric: cc|nesting> | <count> | <reason>
#
# cc = cyclomatic complexity (limit 15); nesting = block depth relative to the
# function body (limit 5). Four-way contract: a new offender, growth, an
# unrecorded shrink and a stale freeze all fail, so a real simplification means
# updating or deleting the row in the same change.
